@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam linetype polyline
hide empty description

[*] --> Visible : created visible to everyone
[*] --> Restricted : created with roles
[*] --> Hidden : created not visible
Visible --> Restricted : roles chosen
Restricted --> Visible : roles removed
Visible --> Hidden : hidden
Hidden --> Visible : shown
Visible --> Unavailable : Moodle stops adding it
Unavailable --> Visible : Moodle adds it again
Visible --> [*] : deleted
Restricted --> [*] : deleted
Hidden --> [*] : deleted
Unavailable --> [*] : deleted

note right of Unavailable
  Only an item of Moodle can become unavailable.
  The plugin does not add it while it is.
end note

@enduml
